'''Robb Stark''' is the eldest son of [[Eddard Stark]]. He is proclaimed [[King in the North]] and killed at the [[Red Wedding]].

==Appearance and Character==
Robb has his mother's auburn hair and blue eyes.

==History==
Robb was born at [[Riverrun]] in [[283 AC]]. He trained at arms with [[Jon Snow]] and [[Theon Greyjoy]] at [[Winterfell]].

==Recent Events==
===A Game of Thrones===
Robb calls the banners and is proclaimed [[King in the North]] after his father's death.
===A Storm of Swords===
Robb marries [[Jeyne Westerling]] and is murdered at the [[Red Wedding]].
